# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values if you need to override
# any of them. .env is already gitignored by Rails, so anything you put
# there stays on your machine.

# The InnerTube "WEB_REMIX" client API key. This is NOT a private/billed
# credential, it's the same public key YouTube Music's own website ships
# in its own JavaScript, and every open-source YouTube Music client uses
# identically. You do not need to set this to run the app, it already
# has a working public default baked in as a fallback (see
# app/services/innertube/client.rb). Only set this if Google ever rotates
# the public key and you need to point the app at a new value without
# changing code.
# INNERTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSyC9XL3ZjWddXya6X74dJoCTL-WEYFDNX30
